WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.750
Come forth, Chaos Number 107!

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:08.320
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!!

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:14.120
All the Over Hundred Chaos Numbers are on the field...

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:18.270
Shark. No, Nasch... you're...

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.150
Bare witness, this is my...

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:30.370
... No, this is the Seven Barian Emperors' true power!

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:34.470
I activate the effect of "Barian, the King of Dreams" from my Extra Deck!

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.520
A monster effect from the Extra Deck?

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.670
When there are 3 or more Over Hundred Numbers on the field,

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:45.500
I can treat them all as Level 7 Xyz Material

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:48.550
to Xyz Summon this card!

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:52.470
I Overlay the Level 7 "Dark Knight", "Ragna Infinity",

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:54.470
"Noble Daemon", "Neo Tachyon",

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:59.000
"Giant Hand Red", "Caestus" and "Umbral" together!

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:03.100
I construct the Overlay Network using these 7 monsters!

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:05.820
Xyz Summon!

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:09.650
O, God of War that embodies Chaos.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.620
Let your dearest wish come to me!

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:15.800
Gather, power of the Seven Emperors!

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.500
Chaos Xyz Barian, the King of Dreams!

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:27.420
That's the true...
 ... Power of the Seven Emperors?!

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:30.220
Barian, the King of Dreams!

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:34.820
In the end, I couldn't protect any of you...

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:38.400
Durbe... Mizael... Girag...

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:42.520
Merag... Alito... and Vector...

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:46.520
We wanted to combine our powers and guide the future of the Barians.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:49.220
But we weren't able to make that dream become a reality...

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:51.320
Wh... what is that?

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:55.370
In front of each of the Overlay Materials is one of the Seven Emperors...

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.050
Is that Xyz Monster the Seven Barian Emperors themselves...?

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.800
So this Duel will make...

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.850
... our dreams a reality!

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:12.560
I can feel it, Shark's fighting Spirit.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:15.230
That's his Chaos.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:20.950
Our power will definitely open the way to the Barians' future!

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:22.500
{marker}

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:26.680
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:31.920
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:43.610
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:47.790
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:54.610
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:58.590
the feelings I want to express.

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:07.610
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:10.860
Right now, with you

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:14.790
Oh - By facing each other,

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:21.870
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:26.970
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:32.400
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:37.570
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:47.150
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.210
Here I go, YUMA, ASTRAL!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.500
I activate the second effect of my Barian, the King of Dreams!

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.760
This monster's ATK is equal

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:03.180
to the number of its Chaos Overlay Units times 1000!

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:05.470
7000 Attack!?

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:08.680
<i>"Final Hope!! We Are "Beyond""</i>

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.140
Yuma, the Trap!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.140
Right!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:11.100
I activate the Trap "Overlay Blessing"!

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.600
This card, when I got no hand,

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:17.520
and my opponent Special Summons an Xyz Monster,

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.900
lets me draw cards equal to the number of that monster's Xyz Materials!

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:24.070
I draw 7 cards!

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:28.030
I activate yet another effect of my Barian, the King of Dreams!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:32.750
By using an Xyz Material or by paying 400 Life Points,

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:37.000
Barian can use the effects of the Chaos Numbers attached to it as Xyz Materials.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.800
That's...

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:43.800
So it's got the effects of the Chaos Over Hundred Numbers of all 7 Emperors...

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:47.550
Will we be able to last this turn...?

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:50.680
But, I cannot use the same effect

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:53.100
more than once a turn.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.600
This is bad, Yuma.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:59.480
Yes, this is the bonds of us, the Seven Emperors!

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:02.110
I pay 400 Life Points...

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:11.160
I activate the effect of "Chaos Number 107: Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon"!

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:15.750
Once Per Turn, this card can negate the effects of all other cards on the field,

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.500
and return the Game State to how it was at the beginning of this turn!

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.040
Time Tyrant!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.880
As a result, Hope's effects are negated.

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:30.430
As well, you cannot activate card effects on the field that I don't want activated.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:35.270
And now, I... pay 400 Life Points

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:41.150
to activate the effect of Chaos Number 102: Noble Daemon!

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:45.860
An opponent's Monster's Attack becomes 0.

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:52.370
I have decided that the hopes you curs cling to shall be scattered like flowers!

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:01.130
Ah, Hope's...!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.670
Again, I pay 400 Life Points...

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:10.300
...to activate the effect of Chaos Number 103: Ragna Infinity!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:13.470
When an opponent's monster has its Attack change,

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.350
I can inflict that difference as damage to my opponent!

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:19.520
Hope's Attack has changed by 2500.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.730
Thus, you take 2500 damage.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:27.280
Neo Tachyon's effect prevents you from activating cards on the field.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:30.070
- This is the end!
- Not a chance!

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:34.120
I activate the Continuous Trap Card "Ant Barrier" from my hand!

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.080
I can activate it from my hand to negate effect damage

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.790
from an opponent's monster.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:43.920
And then, all monsters I control change to Defense Position.

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:50.800
Furthermore, once per turn, I can negate the attack of an opponent's monster!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.050
A Trap from the hand...

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:56.100
You got through Neo Tachyon's only weakness.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:57.770
But, I'm not done!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:01.730
I... again pay 400 Life Points,

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:05.860
to activate the effect of Chaos Number 106: Giant Hand Red!

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:10.820
This card negates the effects

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:13.410
of all other face-up cards on the field.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.410
What?!

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:18.870
This negates the effects of your Continuous Trap "Ant Barrier"!

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.830
Such fierceness!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.710
Again, I pay 400 Life Points,

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:30.340
to activate the effect of Chaos Number 105: Caestus the Comet!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:34.260
Once per turn, I can destroy an opponent's monster!

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.140
EAT THIS, HOPE!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:48.820
Shit, Hope's been...!

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.740
This is really the end for you curs.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:56.740
Go, Barian, the King of Dreams, attack them directly!

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:01.160
I won't let it end like this!

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:04.210
I activate the effect of the "Gagaga Guardian" from my hand!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.380
When I'd get hit by a direct attack,

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:11.260
I can Special Summon this guy from my hand in face-up Defense Position.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.800
Useless! I again...

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:16.350
Pay 400 Life Points...

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:22.640
To activate the effect of Chaos Number 104: Umbral!

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:26.230
I negate the effect of your monster,

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:29.030
discard a card from your hand

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.900
and halve your Life Points!

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:38.530
Gagaga Guardian's Special Summon is negated!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:43.960
A card from your hand is randomly discarded.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:49.710
And then your Life Points are halved.

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:55.800
Yuma! Astral!

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.600
This is the end, for real.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:04.600
Again, I have Barian, the King of Dreams, attack you both directly!

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.350
Yuma, here it comes!

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:11.070
Vanish before 7000 damage!

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.360
It's over!

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.530
Farewell, Yuma! Astral!

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:17.030
To heck with that!

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:20.160
I activate the effect of the "Rainbow Kuriboh" in my Graveyard.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:26.830
When I receive a direct attack, I can Special Summon this guy from my Graveyard.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:32.130
Then destroy Rainbow Kuriboh!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.180
Ah...

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:40.600
He's got complete control over the effects of all the Chaos Numbers...

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:44.640
Yeah, Shark's really really strong....

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:49.150
You indeed managed to stop the onslaught of us, the Seven Emperors...

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:53.280
I activate the Spell Card "Chaos Tempest Draw"!

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:59.320
If I control a "Chaos" Xyz Monster

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:01.950
and 1 or more Spell or Trap Cards,

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.960
I can destroy all Spell and Trap Cards on the field.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:09.080
And since I destroyed 3 cards,

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:11.750
I get to draw 3 cards.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:17.300
I set three cards face-down, and end my turn.

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:20.930
Phew... that was dangerous.
- Indeed.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:25.060
To be honest, it's pretty much a miracle that we survived that onslaught at all...

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.310
- But... why?
- Huh?

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.860
Why didn't he use any of his Xyz Materials,

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:33.070
but kept paying Life Points?

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.860
I can understand the strategy of not letting Barian, the King of Dreams,

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.030
lose any of its Attack...

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:42.620
But now, our Life Points are pretty much even...

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:46.290
I think I know why.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:53.000
Maybe the souls of the other Seven Emperors are in each of its Xyz Material.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:59.050
I felt it when he as attacking.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:02.510
I'm sure Shark's trying to fight this Duel

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.560
with the other Emperors by his side.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:07.600
With the others...

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:11.850
That monster is pretty much the Seven Barian Emperors themselves.

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:15.570
Shark's just tryin' to protect the bonds of his friendship.

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:19.110
Those guys were absorbed

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:21.820
by the powerful Chaos they tried to use.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:25.740
But Shark's Chaos is totally different.

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:27.660
It's like Ena said.

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:31.330
To live for others... to protect others...

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.540
I'm pretty sure this is the power of life...

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:40.510
So, he's been keeping control of the real power of his Chaos up to now?

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:46.850
Then, he's essentially showing us the full power of Chaos.

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:50.350
Heheheh... it sounds pretty awesome, don't it?

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.650
Yuma, I still don't understand.

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:58.110
I've been fighting to ensure the survival of the Astral World.

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:02.530
However, does that mean it's okay if I destroy the Barian World?

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:04.820
No way!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:07.660
I ain't lettin' either of those things happen!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.450
It's 'cause I don't want any of those things to happen...

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.500
No, not I, WE, fight.

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:15.080
Don't you agree, Astral?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.630
I do, Yuma.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.300
Let's do it, Astral!

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.130
I and-
- I shall!

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:24.180
BRING IT TO'EM!

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:27.930
I Overlay you and me together!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:35.480
When the power of hearts linked by their bonds become one,

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:38.480
the Legend with the Miracle of Light is born!

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:40.990
XYZ Change...

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.740
... ZeXal!

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:50.660
So you've arrived, ZeXal?

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:05.340
What...? What on earth is going on!?

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.010
Eh?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:11.810
Wh... what the?

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:17.400
No way, our worlds

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.730
are rapidly approaching?!

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.190
Just what the heck's goin' on?!

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:26.570
The force of our Duel has become more and more intense...

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.830
...so perhaps it is attracting the Earth-Barian World fusion

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:33.700
and the Astral World towards one another...?

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:37.920
Th... that!

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:41.800
If the three worlds collide,

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:46.130
both our world and the Astral World

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.180
won't survive until the end of the Duel.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.980
- Ah...
- There's no escape!

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:00.770
- What's going to happen to us?
- I'm scared!

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:03.360
- What's that?!
- We're doomed!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:07.780
In Summary, what's going to happen to Earth?

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:11.530
- Yuma...
- Calm yourselves, everyone!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:14.750
We can't give up on our hopes and future!

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:18.960
Friends of mine are fighting their hardest

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.460
to make sure we have a future.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:25.300
My big brother gave up his life to make sure his friends could protect our future!

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:26.920
So, not give up.

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:30.760
That's right! Yuma sure is fighting for us all!

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:32.220
Yeah, absolutely!

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:39.310
Kazuma... Kazuma, can you hear me?

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.520
That voice... is that you, Byron!?

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.440
Long time no see.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:45.780
Yeah.

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.440
Thank you, by the way.

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:50.530
Your sons helped Yuma grow.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.780
Heh, that's my line.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.870
Thanks to Yuma, I got my family back.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:58.910
But we have no time for a chat.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:02.250
My sons have placed all their Hopes on Yuma,

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:03.710
who is in a crisis now.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.920
- Understood.
- As you can see,

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:10.260
the three worlds are colliding. However, if we...

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.430
Byron!

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:15.010
I want to use the last ounce of my strength to help Yuma.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:26.650
Yuma!

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:31.610
Yuma, can you hear me?

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:33.200
Dad!?

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.870
We're going to hold it off as much as possible!

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.830
Allow me to witness your destinies.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:42.790
Tron...

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:01.390
Now, continue the Duel!

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:05.610
The Duel that'll decide your future!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.280
The two of them have stopped the collision!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:13.030
- Yuma, now!
- Got it!

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.820
Tron! Dad!

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.240
All right! It's my turn!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.580
All the Light and Power!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:23.870
Come to dwell in my right hand to light the path of hope!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:28.880
Shining Draw!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:35.590
I activate the Spell Card "Overlay Drop Reborn" from my hand!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:41.180
By sending a Level 4 or lower monster from my hand to the Graveyard,

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:45.350
I can Special Summon a Rank 4 or lower monster from my hand!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:48.400
Revive! Number 39!

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.820
Hope, the King of Wishes!

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:57.490
And then I can take control over Xyz Materials attached to your Monster,

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.370
up to the number of Ranks Hope has!

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:01.250
Hope's a Rank 4!

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:04.250
So I detach 4 Xyz Material from Barian!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:08.250
Like hell you will! I activate a Trap Card! "Overlay Menace"!

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:14.130
When the Xyz Materials of monsters I control are targeted by a card effect,

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.340
I can negate that effect!

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:19.640
Then I get to draw a card.

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:22.850
Finally, after each Xyz Material on my field,

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:25.190
I gain 500 Life Points

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:30.110
Since I didn't detach any Xyz Material,

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:31.690
Hope's Attack becomes 0!

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.650
So he had a way to protect his Xyz Material...

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:37.570
But, we aren't done yet!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:41.240
I activate "Rank-Up-Magic - Astral Force"!

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:45.330
Eliphas! This card that carries your hopes and dreams

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:49.630
will now make them a reality in this Duel!

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:55.420
This card targets the monster with the highest Rank on my field!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:57.300
Then, I can Special Summon

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:01.600
a Xyz Monster whose Rank is One or Two higher than its!

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:04.680
This is all of our power!

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:07.850
Rank-Up Xyz Change!

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.860
Smash through the Limits, Hope, King of Wishes!

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:21.450
Reveal yourself, Number 39!

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:25.330
When people embrace a dream that exists beyond hope,

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:29.330
a new future appears far off in the distance!

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:48.890
Go beyond the limits and seize that future in your own hands!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:53.360
"Beyond the Hope", the King of Wishes!

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:02.820
Beyond the Hope, attack!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:07.830
This monster is unaffected by my opponent's monster effects!

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:13.460
It doesn't matter what effects your Beyond the Hope has,

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:16.670
it still has less Attack Points!

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:27.810
I activate the other effect of my Beyond The Hope!

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:32.270
During my turn, whenever it battles an opponent's monster, that monster's attack becomes Zero!

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:34.980
- WHAT!?

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:37.280
Now, Beyond The Hope!

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:39.860
Hope Sword Beyond Slash!

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:43.160
I activate the Trap Card "Xyz Trip"!

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:46.490
When an Xyz Monster I control would be attacked,

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.450
I can end the Battle Phase instead!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:49.750
What!?

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:55.290
No way!

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:59.260
But, in order to pay for that attack,

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:03.550
I have to pay Life Points equal to Beyond The Hope's 3000 Attack.

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:13.850
Shark, you really will keep doing that...

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:18.020
I set three cards face-down and end my turn!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:23.110
Yuma... Astral...! I won't lose!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:28.240
My turn, draw!

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:32.040
Barian, the King of Dreams! Attack Beyond the Hope!

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:35.210
Land Chariot's Slash!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:39.210
I activate a Trap! Overlay Weaker!

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:43.340
When two Xyz Monsters battle,

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:47.010
this card lets the Xyz Monster with less Xyz Material gain Attack!

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:51.350
It gains 600 Attack for each Xyz Material the opponent's Xyz Monster has!

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:56.230
Beyond The Hope's Attack exceeded Barian, the King of Dreams'!

00:20:57.440 --> 00:21:01.280
Not yet! I pay 400 Life Points to activate...

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:04.110
... Ragna Infinity's Effect!

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:06.950
When an opponent's monster has its Attack change,

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:09.580
I can inflict the difference as damage to my opponent!

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.500
Take 4200 damage and <i>vanish</i>!

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:18.420
I won't let you! I activate the Trap Card "Damage Reactor"!

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:21.590
When I would receive Effect Damage,

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.630
I can negate that damage

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:27.340
and my monster gains 800 Attack!

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:31.560
That's 8000 Attack!

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:34.980
Go! Beyond the Hope!

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:37.770
I swear to Heaven and Earth!

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:41.150
I will keep fighting no matter what, in order to make sure tomorrow comes!

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:44.360
Shine forth, oh Ray of Hope!

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:47.280
Hope Sword Beyond Slash!

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:51.830
You did it!

00:21:55.830 --> 00:22:00.460
Why is it that you two keep on crushing my... no, <i>our</i> Dreams!!?

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:05.130
Yuma! Astral!

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:10.260
{marker}

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.890
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:16.310
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:18.600
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:22.270
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:24.860
Let it go.

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:38.160
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:43.380
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:49.300
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:54.640
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:59.440
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:05.360
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:07.530
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:11.910
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:15.790
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:17.540
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:22.000
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:24.130
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:26.960
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:29.380
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:32.890
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:45.440
Our deathmatch against Nasch seem to go on forever.

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:50.900
As both of them refused to lose, a nostalgic monster emerged from the blasts.

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:52.700
Black Ray Lancer?!

00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:55.660
We can do that too! Come forth, Hope!

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:58.330
Will we ever understand each other?

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:00.460
I am the guide of the Barian World!

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:02.960
Next Time, on Yu-Gi-Oh ZeXaL II!

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:06.420
"The Aloof Duelist "Nasch" - The Destined Last Duel!!"

00:24:06.460 --> 00:24:09.380
Come at me with all you've got!
